model t
  tally 2
  on 2025-12-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input ws: date
input we: date

move early: transfers
  on ws
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

move late: transfers
  on we
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-11-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  ws = window(2025-12-30, 2026-01-03) "s"
  we = window(2026-06-28, 2026-07-03) "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask s4: count(t in transfers over 2025-12-01 .. 2026-01-31)
ask s4w: count(t in transfers over 2025-12-01 .. 2026-01-31) windows each
ask s4a: count(t in transfers over 2025-12-01 .. 2026-01-31) with ws = 2025-12-30
ask s4b: count(t in transfers over 2025-12-01 .. 2026-01-31) with ws = 2026-01-02
